@startuml
title Merchant onboarding and admin approval — Proposed 2.0
skinparam shadowing false
|Applicant|
start
:RegisterMerchant with authenticated own details;
|Merchant API|
:Validate input; create Pending business;
|React Admin|
:Review application;
if (Approve?) then (yes)
  |Merchant API|
  :SetMerchantStatus Approved; audit;
  |React Admin|
  :Provision verified membership/role through Identity admin;
  |Merchant owner|
  :CreateApiKey; copy one-time secret securely;
else (no)
  |Merchant API|
  :Set Rejected with reason; no API key access;
endif
stop
@enduml
